# ⚡ Urban Pulse — Local Event & Concert Platform
**Client-Side Development (Coursework Two)**
*Module:* COM109 Client-Side Development  
*Submission Date:* Noon, 13/08/2026  


## 📖 Project Overview
**Urban Pulse** is a contemporary, accessible multi-page web platform designed for discovering local city culture, live concerts, underground synth workshops, and street markets. The site features interactive stage lineups using jQuery, dynamic client-side form validation with real-time pricing calculations, and active session persistence.


